{"step_index":341,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T05:55:19Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-03T23:55:19-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-03T23:55:19-06:00\nShowing lines 1-36 of 36\n1: @echo off\n2: chcp 65001 >nul\n3: title Retenedor Anti-Watchdog Fastboot - ZTE B866V2 (U-Boot 2015.01-g220e992)\n4: color 0A\n5: \n6: set \"ROM_DIR=%~dp0..\\..\\V2\\B866v2 Android 12\\B866v2 Android 12\\B866V2\"\n7: cd /d \"%ROM_DIR%\"\n8: \n9: echo ================================================================================\n10: echo   RETENEDOR ANTI-WATCHDOG PARA FASTBOOT (ZTE B866V2 - U-Boot 2015.01-g220e992)\n11: echo ================================================================================\n12: echo   Evita que el temporizador Watchdog (reboot_mode:::: watchdog_reboot) reinicie\n13: echo   la placa por inactividad USB y cargue el sistema normal (ztebsp: bootcmd=bootsys).\n14: echo.\n15: echo   [PASO EN SMARTTY (Consola # de Recovery antes de reiniciar a Fastboot)]:\n16: echo     echo -n \"boot-recovery\" ^> /dev/block/misc ; sync ; reboot bootloader\n17: echo ================================================================================\n18: echo.\n19: echo [*] Esperando a que la placa entre en modo Fastboot...\n20: \n21: :WAIT_LOOP\n22: for /f \"tokens=1,2\" %%A in ('fastboot devices 2^>nul') do (\n23:     if \"%%B\"==\"fastboot\" (\n24:         echo [+] Placa detectada en Fastboot (%%A). Enviando desactivacion de Watchdog...\n25:         fastboot oem \"watchdog off\" 2>nul\n26:         goto :KEEP_ALIVE\n27:     )\n28: )\n29: goto :WAIT_LOOP\n30: \n31: :KEEP_ALIVE\n32: echo [*] Mantenimiento Anti-Watchdog activo (pulso USB cada 2s). Presiona Ctrl+C para salir.\n33: :PULSE_LOOP\n34: fastboot getvar version >nul 2>&1\n35: timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul\n36: goto :PULSE_LOOP"}
